    "  2. assets/textures/_generated/<name>/ (procedural cache)",
    "  3. generate procedurally now (render/texture_gen.py) and cache",
    "uv_scale = metres of world space covered by one texture repeat.",
    "surface = gameplay surface type (footsteps, impacts, penetration)."
